WEBVTT

01:29.700 --> 01:31.620
[Blood River]

01:31.620 --> 01:33.980
[Based on the novel of the same name from Zhou Munan's Youth in Jianghu series]

01:33.980 --> 01:35.980
[Available on fanqienovel.com & bkneng.com]

01:36.220 --> 01:38.980
[Episode 22]

01:43.760 --> 01:44.980
Keep your dirty dealings hidden.

01:45.560 --> 01:47.100
If you expose yourself

01:47.200 --> 01:47.820
in Wushuang City,

01:48.870 --> 01:50.380
I won't be able to keep you safe.

01:56.590 --> 01:57.130
I...

01:57.510 --> 01:57.930
Haoyue,

01:58.150 --> 01:59.100
mind your manners!

02:02.230 --> 02:02.920
I, Haoyue,

02:03.430 --> 02:04.100
offer my greetings, sir.

02:08.120 --> 02:10.220
So, you're the head of Tianxia House?

02:10.590 --> 02:11.100
Yes,

02:11.470 --> 02:12.060
I am.

02:12.590 --> 02:13.680
I know all about the deals

02:13.680 --> 02:15.220
you made with my foolish disciple.

02:15.840 --> 02:16.780
The reason I didn't interfere

02:17.190 --> 02:18.890
is not because I approved of them,

02:19.710 --> 02:20.800
but because the matter

02:20.800 --> 02:21.850
was too trivial

02:22.300 --> 02:24.610
to be worth a fuss.

02:32.360 --> 02:32.980
Master...

02:35.080 --> 02:36.260
I know full well that you're useless.

02:37.520 --> 02:38.730
Even though you can't protect

02:38.750 --> 02:39.780
this city with martial skill,

02:41.520 --> 02:42.570
you can still serve it

02:43.750 --> 02:44.820
in other ways.

02:46.150 --> 02:47.240
But don't waste

02:47.240 --> 02:48.660
what little wit you have

02:49.570 --> 02:51.690
on greed and profit.

02:52.750 --> 02:53.540
Do you understand?

02:54.690 --> 02:55.660
Yes, Master.

02:57.240 --> 02:58.100
Do you still remember

02:58.800 --> 03:00.610
how you became my disciple?

03:02.400 --> 03:03.060
Of course.

03:03.680 --> 03:05.730
That year, a flood struck my hometown.

03:06.000 --> 03:06.780
Everyone died

03:07.360 --> 03:08.560
except me.

03:08.560 --> 03:09.730
I clung to a tree and survived.

03:10.520 --> 03:11.760
It was you who passed by and saved me.

03:12.360 --> 03:12.940
Though I

03:13.190 --> 03:14.290
was slow to learn martial arts,

03:14.470 --> 03:15.170
you kept me

03:15.190 --> 03:15.980
by your side,

03:16.280 --> 03:17.220
and I've followed you

03:17.310 --> 03:18.010
ever since.

03:20.680 --> 03:21.450
I know

03:22.000 --> 03:23.500
you grew up in the wild

03:24.680 --> 03:26.450
and never took to life in Wushuang City.

03:29.630 --> 03:31.380
But I saved your life,

03:33.310 --> 03:35.100
so you must repay me

03:35.690 --> 03:36.890
and serve Wushuang City.

03:37.750 --> 03:38.450
Yes, Master.

03:40.870 --> 03:41.540
Rise.

03:50.870 --> 03:51.410
Little Wushuang.

03:52.000 --> 03:52.540
Master.

03:53.240 --> 03:53.780
Come here.

04:00.360 --> 04:01.130
From now on,

04:02.310 --> 04:03.610
you must take good care of your junior brother.

04:05.800 --> 04:06.290
I've always

04:06.710 --> 04:07.890
treated him well.

04:09.150 --> 04:10.260
When he becomes the City Lord,

04:15.680 --> 04:16.810
you must be loyal to him.

04:18.120 --> 04:18.850
Yes, Master.

04:19.040 --> 04:20.250
Serve him with your life.

04:21.950 --> 04:22.700
I will, Master.

04:26.720 --> 04:27.290
Send word:

04:28.270 --> 04:29.660
for the upcoming sword duel,

04:30.190 --> 04:30.730
Wushuang City

04:31.310 --> 04:33.050
welcomes heroes from all lands to witness it.

04:34.070 --> 04:34.780
Have every visitor

04:35.240 --> 04:36.290
registered by name

04:37.070 --> 04:38.220
and make this clear to them:

04:38.920 --> 04:40.050
a sword shows no mercy;

04:40.480 --> 04:41.900
life or death is their own to bear.

04:42.310 --> 04:42.930
But

04:43.480 --> 04:44.460
there's never been

04:44.510 --> 04:45.220
such a precedent before.

04:46.390 --> 04:47.100
I know

04:48.040 --> 04:50.340
they all want to see Wushuang City fall,

04:51.430 --> 04:52.980
so I will let them come and see.

04:53.920 --> 04:54.610
They will learn

04:55.600 --> 04:57.220
soon enough that it will never happen.

05:00.210 --> 05:01.490
Wushuang City

05:02.250 --> 05:03.930
may not rival Xueyue City,

05:05.240 --> 05:05.780
but

05:06.800 --> 05:08.900
it is not to be taken lightly.

05:10.390 --> 05:11.340
Not to be

05:13.750 --> 05:14.290
taken lightly?

05:15.270 --> 05:15.980
Master!

05:17.480 --> 05:18.100
Master!

05:23.750 --> 05:25.140
Why is Master in such a temper today?

05:25.510 --> 05:26.540
Did he take the wrong medicine?

05:29.430 --> 05:31.220
Could the City Lord just be bluffing?

05:31.950 --> 05:32.980
How could he have chosen

05:32.980 --> 05:34.120
the next City Lord already?

05:34.310 --> 05:35.050
And it's a child?

05:38.490 --> 05:39.610
Don't underestimate that child.

05:40.070 --> 05:41.750
Master is already the finest martial artist

05:41.750 --> 05:43.220
Wushuang City has seen in generations.

05:43.950 --> 05:44.620
But that boy's

05:44.620 --> 05:45.730
gift for swordsmanship

05:45.870 --> 05:46.850
surpasses even his.

05:49.560 --> 05:50.170
By contrast,

05:50.600 --> 05:51.580
I was never suited for martial arts.

05:52.160 --> 05:54.100
Yes, I am the chief disciple,

05:55.360 --> 05:56.580
but that title means nothing at all.

05:58.630 --> 05:59.770
If that child

05:59.770 --> 06:01.460
really becomes the City Lord,

06:01.800 --> 06:02.850
then we only need to get rid of him,

06:03.310 --> 06:04.850
and the whole city will be...

06:08.600 --> 06:09.370
Useless wretch!

06:10.430 --> 06:11.730
At least I know I am useless.

06:12.190 --> 06:13.780
You don't even know your own place.

06:14.630 --> 06:15.660
People like us

06:15.830 --> 06:16.720
must rely on the strong.

06:16.720 --> 06:17.660
We cannot command them.

06:18.390 --> 06:19.900
We belong in the shadows.

06:21.390 --> 06:22.850
If you can't even understand that,

06:23.430 --> 06:24.610
Tianxia House does not need you.

06:24.920 --> 06:25.370
Understood.

06:25.830 --> 06:26.340
Understood.

06:26.630 --> 06:27.290
Useless.

06:40.870 --> 06:42.460
If even you know we must rely on the strong,

06:43.870 --> 06:45.050
do you really think I see you as my backer?

06:46.630 --> 06:47.340
I will wait

06:48.430 --> 06:49.610
for the day you and Wushuang City

06:50.560 --> 06:51.340
fall together.

06:58.270 --> 06:58.980
Master, look!

06:59.430 --> 07:00.370
It's so lively here!

07:01.390 --> 07:01.930
Are you happy?

07:02.190 --> 07:02.780
Yes, I am!

07:03.630 --> 07:04.220
Little Wushuang,

07:05.270 --> 07:05.930
what do you

07:06.070 --> 07:07.250
think of Senior Brother Lu?

07:08.270 --> 07:10.170
He is a bit slow.

07:10.750 --> 07:11.410
Indeed.

07:11.830 --> 07:13.610
He is slow in martial arts.

07:14.040 --> 07:14.930
But remember,

07:15.120 --> 07:16.580
everyone has their strengths.

07:17.160 --> 07:18.410
Though he's not a good fighter,

07:18.830 --> 07:20.020
he is very smooth

07:20.120 --> 07:21.050
at getting by in the world.

07:21.510 --> 07:22.580
In some ways, he even

07:23.000 --> 07:23.660
outshines me.

07:24.190 --> 07:24.810
Master,

07:25.600 --> 07:27.250
why are you acting so strangely today?

07:27.750 --> 07:29.700
Tanghulu!
[*candied fruit]

07:30.600 --> 07:33.700
Big and sweet tanghulu!

07:35.510 --> 07:36.020
Master.

07:36.040 --> 07:36.660
Would you like a stick?

07:36.910 --> 07:37.530
It'll be one wen.

07:38.720 --> 07:39.220
Thank you.

07:41.430 --> 07:42.900
Do you want this one?

07:44.390 --> 07:44.980
This one?

07:46.560 --> 07:47.220
Thank you.

07:50.480 --> 07:51.420
Did you think I acted strangely

07:51.420 --> 07:52.940
because I didn't buy you

07:53.040 --> 07:54.050
tanghulu today?

07:56.600 --> 07:57.140
Here.

07:57.830 --> 07:58.660
Thank you, Master.

08:01.600 --> 08:02.700
Though I'm only 30 years old,

08:04.920 --> 08:06.140
compared to Baili Dongjun and the others,

08:07.000 --> 08:08.540
I'm more like one from their elders' generation.

08:11.120 --> 08:12.290
I lack their pride

08:13.120 --> 08:14.580
and their drive.

08:16.600 --> 08:17.460
That's not how it should be.

08:21.390 --> 08:22.100
Do you understand?

08:33.600 --> 08:34.890
If I die one day,

08:37.030 --> 08:37.980
you must trust

08:37.980 --> 08:38.820
Senior Brother Lu.

08:39.630 --> 08:41.010
He may be greedy for small gains,

08:41.600 --> 08:42.280
but

08:42.390 --> 08:44.370
he is an honest and kind boy.

08:46.320 --> 08:47.310
He will take care of you

08:47.310 --> 08:48.060
just as I have,

08:49.440 --> 08:50.460
and he'll buy you

08:50.460 --> 08:51.610
sweet tanghulu too.

08:58.840 --> 08:59.650
In the days to come,

09:00.840 --> 09:01.650
if you love sword practice,

09:02.150 --> 09:03.180
train as much as you wish.

09:03.960 --> 09:05.530
With your talent,

09:06.000 --> 09:07.610
you can surely become known as a sword deity.

09:08.360 --> 09:09.730
But if you don't wish to train, that's fine too.

09:10.960 --> 09:12.370
Travel the world,

09:12.960 --> 09:13.810
and see

09:13.810 --> 09:15.250
its mountains and rivers.

09:19.240 --> 09:20.250
As for me,

09:21.200 --> 09:22.980
I will not have that chance in this life.

09:26.080 --> 09:26.850
Master.

09:27.360 --> 09:28.650
Master, you can't die yet!

09:29.000 --> 09:29.820
You still have to

09:29.840 --> 09:30.850
buy me more tanghulu!

09:32.870 --> 09:33.460
All right.

09:35.480 --> 09:36.700
I will buy you tanghulu,

09:37.910 --> 09:39.890
and your senior brother will too.

09:40.240 --> 09:40.890
All right?

09:41.150 --> 09:41.820
All right!

09:42.720 --> 09:43.300
Let's go.

09:56.630 --> 09:57.130
Miss Bai.

09:57.240 --> 09:57.770
Mr. Su.

09:59.080 --> 09:59.610
Mr. Su.

09:59.630 --> 10:00.250
Miss Bai.

10:12.870 --> 10:13.370
Mr. Su.

10:13.870 --> 10:15.060
Mr. Su, please take this tobacco.

10:19.550 --> 10:20.100
Miss Bai.

10:20.910 --> 10:21.940
The medicine you prescribed for my mother

10:22.030 --> 10:22.700
worked wonders.

10:23.120 --> 10:24.010
She's much better now.

10:24.960 --> 10:25.980
Don't mention it.

10:26.200 --> 10:27.300
The clinic is closed today.

10:27.480 --> 10:28.080
Bring her back

10:28.080 --> 10:29.530
for a return visit in a few days.

10:30.030 --> 10:30.580
All right.

10:30.790 --> 10:32.250
I won't keep you any longer. See you.

10:35.550 --> 10:36.420
Before we left,

10:36.440 --> 10:37.580
didn't you tell the maid

10:37.670 --> 10:38.420
you wouldn't return

10:38.550 --> 10:40.220
without buying a carriage full of things?

10:40.670 --> 10:41.700
Why haven't you bought anything?

10:42.600 --> 10:43.980
Nothing has caught my eye.

10:53.240 --> 10:53.730
Sir.

10:54.030 --> 10:54.650
Coming!

10:56.630 --> 10:57.220
It's you, Miss Bai.

10:57.910 --> 10:58.490
What would you like?

10:59.390 --> 11:00.770
A pot of Longjing tea

11:01.120 --> 11:01.770
and a plate of mung bean cakes.

11:02.150 --> 11:02.820
Coming right up.

11:04.600 --> 11:05.060
Waiter,

11:05.240 --> 11:05.820
bring the tea.

11:13.240 --> 11:13.770
Here, Miss Bai.

11:14.120 --> 11:15.530
Our finest tea

11:15.790 --> 11:16.650
and freshly baked mung bean cakes.

11:17.000 --> 11:17.610
Please enjoy.

11:28.000 --> 11:28.730
What's wrong, Miss Bai?

11:29.120 --> 11:30.650
Is our tea or our dessert

11:30.840 --> 11:31.370
not to your liking?

11:32.510 --> 11:33.250
It's not that.

11:33.440 --> 11:34.460
It's just me.

11:35.320 --> 11:36.130
I set out today

11:36.240 --> 11:37.890
hoping for a pleasant outing.

11:38.150 --> 11:39.340
I felt cheerful at first,

11:39.720 --> 11:40.940
but after walking half the day,

11:41.200 --> 11:42.340
everything felt dull.

11:42.870 --> 11:44.340
But Nan'an City is famous far and wide

11:44.510 --> 11:45.250
for its curious

11:45.360 --> 11:46.340
and delightful trinkets.

11:48.150 --> 11:49.700
That said, you've been here

11:49.720 --> 11:50.530
for some time now.

11:50.870 --> 11:51.940
Even the most exciting place

11:52.030 --> 11:52.940
grows dull

11:53.360 --> 11:54.370
after a while,

11:54.550 --> 11:55.220
don't you think?

11:55.960 --> 11:56.650
Maybe

11:56.840 --> 11:58.220
you can try seeing it as your home.

11:58.630 --> 11:59.130
Then

11:59.390 --> 12:00.820
you may view

12:00.870 --> 12:02.100
this city differently

12:02.390 --> 12:03.220
and feel different about it.

12:05.840 --> 12:06.820
That makes sense.

12:08.240 --> 12:09.300
But maybe I should travel farther

12:09.300 --> 12:10.490
and see more of the world.

12:12.000 --> 12:13.370
That might be a good idea.

12:14.670 --> 12:15.460
Please enjoy.

12:17.720 --> 12:18.820
You find it boring

12:19.390 --> 12:20.500
because you think

12:20.500 --> 12:21.940
the person beside you is boring.

12:22.910 --> 12:23.610
Just eat your food.

12:28.270 --> 12:28.890
Have you heard?

12:29.390 --> 12:30.010
Something big

12:30.120 --> 12:31.130
happened recently.

12:31.670 --> 12:32.370
What big thing?

12:33.750 --> 12:35.370
Do you mean the orphan from No-Sword City,

12:35.550 --> 12:36.180
Zhuo Yue'an,

12:36.240 --> 12:37.100
challenging Wushuang City?

12:37.320 --> 12:37.890
That's right.

12:38.440 --> 12:39.370
I heard he defeated

12:39.600 --> 12:40.300
several elders

12:40.600 --> 12:41.700
and even the old City Lord.

12:42.030 --> 12:42.530
Father,

12:42.840 --> 12:43.300
did you hear that?

12:43.630 --> 12:45.060
It sounds like they're talking about Su Muyu.

12:45.910 --> 12:46.490
Be quiet.

12:46.910 --> 12:48.110
Let me hear how Su Muyu is doing.

12:48.110 --> 12:48.850
Everyone's talking about it.

12:50.750 --> 12:52.340
This news has probably spread

12:52.390 --> 12:53.300
throughout the martial world.

12:59.360 --> 12:59.770
Sir,

13:00.080 --> 13:00.580
check, please.

13:01.390 --> 13:01.980
Take care.

13:02.000 --> 13:02.570
Please.

13:07.600 --> 13:08.680
You can rest easy now.

13:08.790 --> 13:10.890
He came out of his duels in Wushuang City unscathed.

13:12.360 --> 13:13.940
He'll probably be back

13:14.360 --> 13:15.420
in a few days.

13:19.670 --> 13:20.220
Father!

13:21.790 --> 13:22.820
Don't be rash.

13:23.270 --> 13:24.770
How many days will it take to reach Wushuang City?

13:26.480 --> 13:27.060
Half a month.

13:27.750 --> 13:29.650
If you run into storms

13:30.240 --> 13:31.610
or snow,

13:31.960 --> 13:33.060
it could take at least a month.

13:36.630 --> 13:38.130
What if I ride hard and change horses

13:38.270 --> 13:39.060
along the way?

13:41.080 --> 13:42.340
It will take at least seven days.

13:42.630 --> 13:43.610
Heading to Wushuang City?

13:44.120 --> 13:45.730
There's a ship docked at the east pier today.

13:46.550 --> 13:47.700
It will sail east and reach

13:47.870 --> 13:49.010
Luoyang tomorrow.

13:49.270 --> 13:50.460
From Luoyang, Wushuang City

13:50.550 --> 13:51.250
is only 100 li away.

13:54.150 --> 13:54.700
Mind your own business!

14:02.670 --> 14:03.250
Master Ji,

14:03.750 --> 14:04.890
the news has already spread.

14:05.720 --> 14:07.340
Except for Zhao Yuzhen, the Profound Sword Deity,

14:07.840 --> 14:08.650
all the other sword deities

14:08.790 --> 14:10.340
will go to Wushuang City.

14:12.030 --> 14:13.010
Do you really need

14:13.320 --> 14:14.570
to come report something like that

14:14.570 --> 14:15.650
to me in person?

14:16.630 --> 14:17.650
There is another piece of news.

14:18.000 --> 14:18.820
It is related to the rule

14:18.870 --> 14:19.940
you set before.

14:25.240 --> 14:26.180
Blood River's Spider Woman

14:26.600 --> 14:27.700
has been hiring agents

14:28.240 --> 14:29.220
to search for a certain person.

14:31.080 --> 14:32.530
She's looking for Lianyue, isn't she?

14:35.200 --> 14:37.100
He has been missing for quite some time.

14:37.630 --> 14:38.880
Since he visited the Tang Clan,

14:39.360 --> 14:40.940
there's been no word from him.

14:41.360 --> 14:42.660
Most of our agents in Shuzhong

14:42.910 --> 14:43.960
have also been discovered

14:43.960 --> 14:44.930
by the Tang Clan.

14:45.790 --> 14:46.540
Since that's the case,

14:47.200 --> 14:49.090
let's see

14:49.150 --> 14:50.900
whether this beauty from Blood River

14:51.120 --> 14:52.500
will make a move

14:52.910 --> 14:53.540
and what

14:53.790 --> 14:54.420
new information

14:54.440 --> 14:55.660
she might bring us.

14:56.150 --> 14:56.810
But

14:56.960 --> 14:58.970
our own people must not relax.

14:59.150 --> 15:00.380
Keep investigating.

15:01.320 --> 15:02.140
Then should I give her

15:02.550 --> 15:03.780
information about the Xuanwu Guardian?

15:07.510 --> 15:09.140
Give it to her if she asks for it.

15:09.670 --> 15:10.330
Remember,

15:10.550 --> 15:11.450
take no payment.

15:13.360 --> 15:13.970
Understood.

15:20.340 --> 15:26.740
[Tianxia House]

15:43.480 --> 15:44.300
It seems

15:44.630 --> 15:45.690
not many people have faith

15:45.960 --> 15:46.610
in our City Lord.

15:51.630 --> 15:52.580
- This is mine. - Song Yanhui can split

15:52.580 --> 15:53.250
a droplet with his sword.

15:53.250 --> 15:54.450
Do you realize how good he is?

15:54.840 --> 15:55.660
I'm betting on Song Yanhui!

15:55.960 --> 15:57.500
[Song Yanhui]
No-Sword City has long been in decline.

15:57.630 --> 15:58.920
This orphan came out of nowhere.

15:58.920 --> 16:00.140
[Zhuo Yue'an]
How could he possibly beat Song Yanhui?

16:00.250 --> 16:01.140
Not a chance!

16:01.270 --> 16:02.300
What do you mean by that?

16:02.550 --> 16:03.690
Age brings wisdom!

16:03.720 --> 16:04.610
Even the previous old City Lord

16:04.720 --> 16:05.780
was wounded by him.

16:06.360 --> 16:06.850
Really?

16:06.850 --> 16:07.900
You can tell he's no ordinary man.

16:10.320 --> 16:11.300
What is he doing here?

16:19.870 --> 16:21.850
Sir, I haven't seen you before.

16:21.960 --> 16:23.300
Is this your first time

16:23.360 --> 16:24.810
at Tianxia House?

16:26.870 --> 16:28.210
I suppose it's my second time.

16:34.150 --> 16:35.260
Pardon my poor eyesight.

16:35.600 --> 16:36.900
What brings you here this time?

16:37.630 --> 16:38.810
Poor eyesight?

16:39.600 --> 16:40.570
Sir,

16:41.000 --> 16:42.260
these people

16:42.600 --> 16:44.060
have noses like hounds.

16:44.360 --> 16:45.200
As soon as someone

16:45.200 --> 16:46.810
with even a hint of money walks in,

16:46.870 --> 16:47.660
they'll act

16:47.750 --> 16:49.020
like they've found their prey.

16:49.240 --> 16:50.900
They'll fix on that person,

16:51.360 --> 16:52.780
and within two hours,

16:52.960 --> 16:54.850
they'll have uncovered his identity, his background,

16:55.120 --> 16:56.140
and exactly how much

16:56.200 --> 16:58.210
he can afford to lose.

16:58.320 --> 16:59.970
Then they'll plan carefully

17:00.670 --> 17:02.660
to drain every coin from him

17:03.000 --> 17:04.700
before he leaves Tianxia House,

17:04.960 --> 17:08.090
down to the last scrap of his wealth.

17:08.110 --> 17:08.740
Isn't this

17:08.830 --> 17:10.570
how you all cheated me

17:10.680 --> 17:11.810
out of everything back then?

17:12.440 --> 17:13.130
Ding,

17:13.160 --> 17:14.090
what nonsense are you spouting?

17:15.880 --> 17:16.370
Sir,

17:16.640 --> 17:17.540
please don't

17:17.590 --> 17:18.700
listen to him.

17:19.160 --> 17:21.980
Who do you plan to bet on this time?

17:26.960 --> 17:28.020
I have no interest

17:28.070 --> 17:29.260
in gambling.

17:30.030 --> 17:31.410
I'm just curious

17:32.750 --> 17:33.700
about what

17:34.720 --> 17:35.650
all this means.

17:37.350 --> 17:38.130
Ah,

17:38.480 --> 17:39.540
it's

17:39.550 --> 17:41.570
about a major event in the martial world.

17:42.240 --> 17:44.170
Zhuo Yue'an, an orphan from No-Sword City,

17:44.440 --> 17:46.650
is challenging Song Yanhui,

17:46.830 --> 17:47.780
the Lord of Wushuang City.

17:48.960 --> 17:50.890
You can bet on Zhuo Yue'an to win

17:51.270 --> 17:52.220
at odds of one to one.

17:52.680 --> 17:53.890
If you wager 100 liang

17:54.310 --> 17:55.220
and he wins,

17:55.510 --> 17:57.260
you'll get 200 liang.

17:58.240 --> 18:00.300
You can also bet on Song Yanhui to win.

18:01.030 --> 18:02.090
If he does,

18:02.440 --> 18:03.220
100 liang

18:03.350 --> 18:05.020
will get you 300 liang.

18:05.880 --> 18:06.410
Of course,

18:06.720 --> 18:08.300
you can also bet

18:08.440 --> 18:09.460
on a draw.

18:10.480 --> 18:11.650
If you guess right,

18:11.960 --> 18:13.610
you'll get 200 liang.

18:16.440 --> 18:17.780
Why does Song Yanhui's win

18:18.590 --> 18:19.740
pay more?

18:21.060 --> 18:21.850
Young man,

18:21.850 --> 18:23.410
you are too naive and clueless.

18:23.470 --> 18:25.220
You'd best go home now.

18:25.300 --> 18:26.200
This casino

18:26.270 --> 18:27.460
is no place

18:27.460 --> 18:28.370
for lambs like you.

18:28.400 --> 18:29.010
You...!

18:31.590 --> 18:32.260
Sir,

18:32.510 --> 18:33.260
it's because

18:33.720 --> 18:34.740
fewer people

18:34.960 --> 18:37.460
are betting on him.

18:37.590 --> 18:40.540
After all, the former Lord of Wushuang City

18:40.720 --> 18:42.240
was already defeated

18:42.240 --> 18:43.810
by Zhuo Yue'an,

18:44.110 --> 18:45.960
and Song Yanhui's reputation

18:45.960 --> 18:47.320
isn't much bigger

18:47.520 --> 18:49.360
than Liu Yunqi's.

18:51.350 --> 18:52.520
I see.

18:53.680 --> 18:54.300
But

18:54.400 --> 18:55.410
more importantly,

18:55.790 --> 18:57.890
everyone loves a good story.

18:58.590 --> 19:01.570
From a sect nearly forgotten by the world

19:02.070 --> 19:06.130
emerges a swordsman unknown to all.

19:06.510 --> 19:09.020
He defeats the chief disciple of Wushuang City,

19:09.310 --> 19:11.500
the Four Swordsman of Lunwu Hall,

19:12.000 --> 19:14.080
Elder Jian Shanyue,

19:14.310 --> 19:17.300
and the former City Lord, Liu Yunqi.

19:18.030 --> 19:19.580
Isn't that

19:19.580 --> 19:21.220
an inspiring tale?

19:22.030 --> 19:22.980
And if he

19:22.980 --> 19:25.780
goes on to defeat the current City Lord,

19:25.840 --> 19:26.930
Song Yanhui,

19:27.720 --> 19:28.940
won't that make

19:29.400 --> 19:30.810
the perfect ending?

19:36.880 --> 19:37.740
How does one place a bet?

19:39.070 --> 19:42.060
The minimum bet is three liang of silver,

19:42.550 --> 19:45.220
and the maximum is an entire city.

19:46.750 --> 19:47.330
All right,

19:48.070 --> 19:49.260
then I'll bet three liang of silver.

19:51.350 --> 19:52.780
After all that talk,

19:53.110 --> 19:55.540
you're only betting three liang?

20:00.440 --> 20:02.060
Then who are you betting on?

20:05.340 --> 20:08.100
[Zhuo Yue'an]

20:09.640 --> 20:10.410
Myself.

20:11.310 --> 20:12.060
I'll bet on him.

20:12.400 --> 20:13.260
Really?

20:14.000 --> 20:15.260
I've never heard of him before.

20:18.270 --> 20:19.780
I've trained in swordsmanship for years,

20:19.880 --> 20:20.890
and I'm still no match for Song Yanhui.

20:21.070 --> 20:22.020
The old City Lord is already formidable,

20:22.240 --> 20:22.810
so this Zhuo Yue'an

20:22.920 --> 20:23.410
must be even greater.

20:23.550 --> 20:24.650
Fine, I'll bet on him then.

20:40.750 --> 20:42.460
He knew I was watching him all along.

20:45.590 --> 20:46.260
No,

20:47.590 --> 20:48.780
not only that.

20:50.350 --> 20:51.650
He also recognized me.

21:00.270 --> 21:01.370
You made the right choice.

21:05.030 --> 21:05.650
Take it.

21:08.550 --> 21:09.890
Master Ji specifically instructed

21:10.160 --> 21:11.410
that this lead be given free of charge.

21:12.110 --> 21:13.410
But it's top secret.

21:13.550 --> 21:14.570
You mustn't share it with anyone.

21:17.960 --> 21:19.220
Would your master really be so generous?

21:22.620 --> 21:24.620
[No new leads]

21:27.110 --> 21:27.850
What does this mean?

21:28.880 --> 21:29.890
So your lead is

21:30.270 --> 21:31.200
that even you

21:31.200 --> 21:32.410
have no new leads on Tang Lianyue?

21:35.640 --> 21:36.940
And you call yourselves all-knowing under heaven?

21:37.960 --> 21:38.610
Get lost!

21:47.060 --> 21:48.820
[No new leads]

21:52.920 --> 21:54.340
- Sir. - Buns!

21:54.550 --> 21:55.530
- Here's your pancake with bone broth. - Fresh...

21:55.530 --> 21:56.500
- Please enjoy. - Meat buns!

21:57.720 --> 21:58.940
Pancakes with bone broth!

21:59.640 --> 22:01.060
Pancakes with bone broth!

22:01.840 --> 22:03.150
Scented sachets and trinkets!

22:03.160 --> 22:05.570
Pancakes with bone broth! One copper coin each!

22:06.000 --> 22:06.740
Yes, sir.

22:06.960 --> 22:07.740
Wushuang City

22:07.750 --> 22:08.780
is a city that never sleeps.

22:09.110 --> 22:09.940
If you get hungry at night,

22:10.070 --> 22:10.850
eat right here.

22:11.110 --> 22:11.700
Sir,

22:12.030 --> 22:13.500
would you like to try our pancake with bone broth?

22:13.750 --> 22:14.650
Only one copper coin each.

22:15.240 --> 22:15.780
No,

22:15.880 --> 22:16.500
thank you.

22:16.820 --> 22:18.680
[Grilled Meat Pancakes with Bone Broth]

22:18.680 --> 22:19.260
All right then.

22:21.680 --> 22:22.410
Night has fallen,

22:23.200 --> 22:24.130
yet it's getting even livelier.

22:25.350 --> 22:26.460
Naturally.

22:26.720 --> 22:27.700
Our main city

22:27.720 --> 22:28.940
is Wushuang City.

22:29.030 --> 22:30.130
Its first City Lord

22:30.240 --> 22:31.540
helped Emperor Tianwu found his empire

22:31.750 --> 22:32.330
and was granted

22:32.350 --> 22:33.940
great autonomy.

22:34.070 --> 22:35.260
Even Sihuai City

22:35.270 --> 22:36.370
has never had a curfew.

22:36.440 --> 22:37.300
So of course,

22:37.400 --> 22:38.650
the nights here are lively.

22:40.960 --> 22:41.890
Sir,

22:42.440 --> 22:43.740
you must be here to watch the duel, right?

22:44.480 --> 22:45.940
Have you found a place to stay?

22:46.550 --> 22:48.220
My home is just nearby.

22:48.480 --> 22:50.090
Three copper coins a night.

22:52.000 --> 22:53.090
Someone's been killed!

22:53.310 --> 22:54.410
Someone's been killed!

22:54.430 --> 22:55.650
- Hurry. - What?

22:55.680 --> 22:56.500
- Run! - What happened?

22:56.500 --> 22:57.240
Someone's been killed!

22:57.240 --> 22:57.810
What...

22:57.810 --> 22:58.620
what's going on?

22:59.790 --> 23:00.940
- Why is everyone running? - Sir.

23:01.030 --> 23:01.850
What happened?

23:01.880 --> 23:03.460
Wushuang City has sent out hundreds of Sword Bearers

23:03.460 --> 23:04.490
to hunt for Zhuo Yue'an.

23:04.510 --> 23:05.130
They're killing anyone they see.

23:05.350 --> 23:06.220
Run!

23:06.310 --> 23:07.330
Sword Bearers?

23:18.720 --> 23:19.890
I came just in time.

23:21.590 --> 23:23.300
But it seems I won't get to watch

23:23.400 --> 23:24.540
the duel tomorrow.

23:28.110 --> 23:29.170
Hurry up...

23:29.830 --> 23:31.810
I don't think they're really after me.

23:32.310 --> 23:33.490
Since Song Yanhui agreed

23:33.490 --> 23:34.400
to the duel,

23:34.480 --> 23:35.780
he won't go back on his word.

23:36.680 --> 23:38.300
If these people are stirring up chaos

23:38.590 --> 23:39.980
and killing people,

23:40.440 --> 23:42.540
it must be to tarnish Song Yanhui's name.

23:43.640 --> 23:44.740
It seems there are traitors

23:44.790 --> 23:45.740
within Wushuang City.

23:46.310 --> 23:47.810
They are trying to use this chance

23:48.350 --> 23:50.300
to take the City Lord's seat from him.

23:53.190 --> 23:54.190
Keep up!

23:56.640 --> 23:57.550
Run!

24:00.620 --> 24:01.330
Hurry!

24:03.160 --> 24:04.850
Are you Zhuo Yue'an?

24:06.640 --> 24:07.260
I am.

24:17.480 --> 24:19.330
He never thought he'd actually

24:19.350 --> 24:20.850
run into Zhuo Yue'an himself.

24:22.030 --> 24:22.980
What are you doing here?

24:23.640 --> 24:24.980
I came to watch the commotion,

24:25.750 --> 24:26.780
but it seems

24:27.350 --> 24:28.780
I've become part of it now.

24:45.160 --> 24:47.020
Should we go straight to the duel tomorrow,

24:47.240 --> 24:48.020
or find Su Muyu

24:48.020 --> 24:49.220
tonight?

24:49.680 --> 24:50.300
There's no rush.

24:50.480 --> 24:51.700
Let's find an inn to stay at.

24:51.830 --> 24:53.410
Then we'll go watch the duel tomorrow.

24:56.270 --> 24:57.330
Trying to give Su Muyu

24:57.350 --> 24:58.460
a surprise, are you?

24:58.480 --> 24:59.540
Father, you...!

25:06.480 --> 25:07.220
Wait.

25:08.110 --> 25:09.060
What's that smell?

25:12.160 --> 25:12.780
What's wrong?

25:13.350 --> 25:14.740
Stop the carriage. We're getting off.

25:23.070 --> 25:24.810
The inn is still some distance ahead.

25:25.000 --> 25:26.500
Why get off now?

25:29.590 --> 25:30.650
Father, lend me a light.

25:30.880 --> 25:31.610
All right.

25:56.240 --> 25:57.570
Are you here to burn incense

25:57.720 --> 25:58.700
for someone who passed away?

26:17.480 --> 26:19.130
You look so serious all of a sudden.

26:19.480 --> 26:21.610
Is there something wrong with Sihuai City?

26:26.070 --> 26:27.220
If there really is a problem,

26:27.750 --> 26:28.500
then it's

26:29.790 --> 26:30.700
a grave one.

26:32.240 --> 26:33.780
People who come to Sihuai City

26:33.790 --> 26:35.500
always act in ways I can't make sense of.

26:36.550 --> 26:38.500
But since you've been generous with your silver,

26:38.590 --> 26:39.370
I'll

26:39.640 --> 26:41.330
wait here a while longer.

26:46.400 --> 26:47.500
Take this pill.

26:47.510 --> 26:48.480
Then drive the carriage

26:48.480 --> 26:49.500
and leave at once.

26:49.590 --> 26:51.260
- What? - You and I have shared

26:51.310 --> 26:52.220
a journey together.

26:52.640 --> 26:54.540
I don't wish to see you die here.

26:55.070 --> 26:56.220
If you can't get out of the city,

26:56.310 --> 26:57.300
find a safe place

26:57.350 --> 26:58.020
to hide.

26:58.880 --> 26:59.540
Huh?

27:00.030 --> 27:01.220
Do as she says,

27:01.680 --> 27:03.570
and you'll live.

27:05.070 --> 27:05.740
Yes.

27:07.000 --> 27:08.020
I understand, madam.

27:20.350 --> 27:21.410
What exactly has gone wrong?

27:21.920 --> 27:22.780
This city

27:23.070 --> 27:24.220
has been poisoned.

27:24.550 --> 27:25.370
Poisoned?

27:26.640 --> 27:27.540
This entire city?

27:28.310 --> 27:30.090
What kind of poison could be so powerful?

27:32.640 --> 27:33.570
It's Blossom Ash.

27:35.400 --> 27:36.890
Its toxicity is mild,

27:37.200 --> 27:39.020
but if one stays long in air

27:39.020 --> 27:40.370
tainted with Blossom Ash,

27:40.790 --> 27:41.780
an ordinary person

27:41.830 --> 27:43.090
will fall unconscious,

27:43.440 --> 27:44.540
while a martial artist

27:44.640 --> 27:45.810
will temporarily lose inner force

27:45.830 --> 27:47.020
and be as good as crippled.

27:47.640 --> 27:48.810
Blossom Ash

27:49.110 --> 27:50.300
spreads widely,

27:50.400 --> 27:51.980
but to poison an entire city

27:52.240 --> 27:53.330
takes years of preparation.

27:54.200 --> 27:55.650
When we first entered the city,

27:55.960 --> 27:56.700
I did not smell

27:56.720 --> 27:57.740
its scent.

27:58.070 --> 27:59.220
Now, halfway through our route,

27:59.680 --> 28:01.170
it's everywhere.

28:01.960 --> 28:03.370
All those years of planning

28:03.960 --> 28:04.810
were leading to this day.

28:07.070 --> 28:08.060
Sihuai City is

28:08.400 --> 28:09.260
about to change.

28:11.790 --> 28:12.500
You're wrong.

28:13.880 --> 28:14.610
Wushuang City

28:15.070 --> 28:17.700
houses only smiths and sect disciples.

28:18.030 --> 28:19.060
Most people

28:19.440 --> 28:21.300
live in Sihuai City.

28:22.440 --> 28:23.780
To seize Wushuang,

28:24.550 --> 28:26.170
one must first take Sihuai.

28:26.550 --> 28:27.260
So,

28:27.750 --> 28:29.940
it is Wushuang City that faces the real upheaval.

28:32.510 --> 28:33.170
Father,

28:33.830 --> 28:34.610
is there any way you can

28:34.750 --> 28:36.130
find Su Muyu quickly?

28:37.110 --> 28:37.780
No problem.

28:48.590 --> 28:49.980
There are others from Blood River here?

28:50.510 --> 28:51.460
Could it be...?

28:51.640 --> 28:53.220
Didn't you say only you came?

28:54.510 --> 28:56.330
I said I came alone from Blood River,

28:56.480 --> 28:57.310
but as for those in Nan'an City,

28:57.310 --> 28:58.130
I can't be sure.

28:58.960 --> 29:00.020
Find a deserted place

29:00.350 --> 29:01.460
and meet up with them.

29:14.110 --> 29:15.940
Will taking this make me all right?

29:16.680 --> 29:18.020
It will only ease the effects for now.

29:18.750 --> 29:19.650
The scent of Blossom Ash

29:19.720 --> 29:20.540
is getting stronger.

29:20.880 --> 29:22.370
We need to find a place

29:22.510 --> 29:24.090
where I can set up an Array of Death in Thirty Feet

29:24.550 --> 29:26.890
to block out the poison.

29:27.960 --> 29:28.610
All right.

29:33.160 --> 29:33.810
Let's go.

29:52.110 --> 29:53.090
Someone's poisoned the city.

29:55.790 --> 29:56.540
Who could it be?

29:59.480 --> 30:00.850
Why is it so quiet today?

30:03.430 --> 30:04.340
You find that strange?

30:05.810 --> 30:06.680
Sihuai City

30:06.680 --> 30:08.090
has never had a curfew.

30:08.750 --> 30:10.500
It's the most famous sleepless city around.

30:12.640 --> 30:13.570
Interesting.

30:14.440 --> 30:15.570
There should be more people

30:15.590 --> 30:17.060
from the martial world here recently.

30:43.110 --> 30:44.410
What's happening?

30:44.510 --> 30:45.130
Don't go.

30:46.720 --> 30:47.460
Sir...

31:03.110 --> 31:04.300
Blossom Ash.

31:19.740 --> 31:21.180
[Floral Poison: Blossom Ash]

31:26.030 --> 31:26.780
Sir,

31:27.110 --> 31:28.370
at a time like this,

31:28.510 --> 31:30.170
you still have the heart to read?

31:30.720 --> 31:31.980
I need to find a way

31:32.350 --> 31:33.810
to break the Blossom Ash Array.

31:33.960 --> 31:35.090
Isn't it a bit late

31:35.160 --> 31:36.610
to start reading now?

31:37.960 --> 31:38.700
No, it's not.

31:38.960 --> 31:40.500
Not until the flame of this candle

31:40.720 --> 31:41.890
burns out completely.

32:07.110 --> 32:08.410
Did they really think they could

32:08.750 --> 32:09.890
harm me with such a petty trick?

32:21.590 --> 32:22.890
Sihuai City has been sealed off.

32:23.480 --> 32:24.650
Did you know about this?

32:26.880 --> 32:27.610
Master,

32:28.000 --> 32:29.260
this has nothing to do with me.

32:30.720 --> 32:31.890
I know it doesn't.

32:33.680 --> 32:35.170
You're bold,

32:36.070 --> 32:37.330
but not that bold.

32:39.790 --> 32:40.780
Who did it?

32:42.510 --> 32:43.170
I don't know.

32:44.350 --> 32:46.300
I received two carrier pigeons,

32:46.310 --> 32:47.370
both sent in haste.

32:48.070 --> 32:49.350
One message said

32:49.350 --> 32:50.540
someone was hunting for Zhuo Yue'an

32:50.540 --> 32:51.570
in Wushuang City's name,

32:51.750 --> 32:53.220
which was clearly an attempt to smear

32:53.220 --> 32:54.500
both the city and you, Master.

32:55.200 --> 32:56.330
The other said

32:56.920 --> 32:58.130
a strange poison had appeared in Sihuai.

32:58.200 --> 32:59.540
Ordinary people have fallen unconscious,

33:00.030 --> 33:00.850
while martial artists

33:00.880 --> 33:01.780
have lost their inner force.

33:01.830 --> 33:02.980
They can't summon any strength at all

33:03.510 --> 33:05.090
and can only send word through carrier pigeons.

33:07.350 --> 33:08.460
Blossom Ash?

33:10.070 --> 33:11.370
Summon Jian Shanyue.

33:14.830 --> 33:15.650
Elder Jian

33:16.960 --> 33:18.170
has announced his retirement.

33:21.750 --> 33:22.810
The one truly in charge of Lunwu Hall

33:23.030 --> 33:24.260
was never Jian Shanyue,

33:24.750 --> 33:25.700
but Jian Wudi.

33:26.830 --> 33:28.460
Jian Wudi has been in seclusion for years,

33:28.920 --> 33:30.260
so he handed most of his authority

33:30.640 --> 33:31.850
to Jian Shanyue.

33:32.310 --> 33:34.020
But Jian Wudi's place of seclusion

33:34.310 --> 33:35.500
is not in Wushuang City.

33:35.920 --> 33:36.540
It's

33:37.880 --> 33:38.980
in Sihuai City.

33:40.960 --> 33:41.540
Master,

33:41.750 --> 33:42.850
what should we do?

33:43.920 --> 33:45.460
I'll go to Sihuai City myself.

33:48.310 --> 33:49.060
Master,

33:49.240 --> 33:50.330
let me go with you!

33:52.030 --> 33:53.980
Jian Wudi has been in seclusion for many years.

33:54.550 --> 33:56.540
If Lunwu Hall is trying to extend its reach into Sihuai City,

33:56.790 --> 33:57.890
it won't be easy.

33:59.240 --> 34:00.130
Tianxia House

34:01.160 --> 34:02.700
is involved in this, isn't it?

34:10.230 --> 34:11.290
My dear disciple,

34:11.960 --> 34:14.340
you thought Tianxia House was loyal to you,

34:14.840 --> 34:16.060
but it seems they had

34:16.440 --> 34:17.820
other plans all along.

34:20.920 --> 34:22.030
I'll go find Lord Haoyue

34:22.030 --> 34:22.770
and get some answers.

34:30.760 --> 34:31.690
If this spear

34:32.190 --> 34:33.940
were thrust into my back,

34:35.280 --> 34:36.690
it wouldn't be so bad.

34:38.110 --> 34:38.770
Master,

34:39.400 --> 34:40.250
I may be useless,

34:40.630 --> 34:41.500
but I'm not a monster!

34:41.500 --> 34:42.610
That's exactly why

34:43.030 --> 34:44.610
I can't bring myself to cast you out.

34:44.920 --> 34:45.820
Do you understand?

35:11.960 --> 35:13.900
Wushuang City is not so lofty

35:14.760 --> 35:16.380
as to stand apart from the world.

35:17.710 --> 35:18.610
But even if it is

35:18.630 --> 35:20.130
no longer peerless under heaven,

35:21.550 --> 35:23.420
the spirit of our forebears still endures.

35:39.760 --> 35:41.210
Do you think what's happening here

35:41.230 --> 35:42.540
is spontaneous

35:42.760 --> 35:44.090
or the result of someone's careful design?

35:45.960 --> 35:47.940
The papers I took from the Wanjuan Tower

35:48.440 --> 35:49.460
had been switched beforehand,

35:50.150 --> 35:51.540
but their contents were genuine.

35:53.320 --> 35:54.130
So my coming here

35:55.150 --> 35:56.690
is something someone wanted to happen.

35:57.000 --> 35:58.860
And you're willing to be used like that?

35:59.880 --> 36:01.170
Since the contents were true,

36:02.070 --> 36:03.730
this is something I must do.

36:03.960 --> 36:05.380
If someone wants to use me,

36:07.190 --> 36:08.860
they'll just have to pay the price.

36:09.320 --> 36:09.940
Fair enough.

36:10.360 --> 36:11.280
And since it's irritating

36:11.280 --> 36:12.460
that so many eyes

36:12.880 --> 36:13.940
are watching us in the dark,

36:14.280 --> 36:15.570
let's use this chance to see

36:15.880 --> 36:17.170
who's really behind it.

36:24.360 --> 36:25.090
Miss Bai?

36:26.920 --> 36:27.690
Your beloved umbrella.

36:27.760 --> 36:28.610
You brought it?

36:29.280 --> 36:29.900
Thank you.

36:30.590 --> 36:31.340
Of course.

36:31.590 --> 36:33.460
I figured you'd need it.

36:33.710 --> 36:35.090
Even if it's not for fighting,

36:35.360 --> 36:36.540
it can at least keep off the rain.

36:39.590 --> 36:40.690
Then take this for protection,

36:41.230 --> 36:41.980
Miss Bai.

36:42.440 --> 36:43.130
All right.

36:45.590 --> 36:46.380
Mr. Zhuo,

36:46.710 --> 36:48.340
you've gained quite a reputation lately.

36:50.000 --> 36:51.190
I thought I was the only one who came

36:51.190 --> 36:52.020
to watch the show.

36:53.110 --> 36:54.170
Watch the show? We're all

36:54.170 --> 36:55.060
about to lose our lives.

36:55.670 --> 36:57.060
Fortunately, before I set out,

36:57.230 --> 36:58.690
my eyelid kept twitching,

36:59.030 --> 37:00.380
so I made extra preparations.

37:00.710 --> 37:01.420
It's only

37:01.440 --> 37:02.500
a few minions.

37:02.960 --> 37:04.340
We've been through much worse.

37:04.710 --> 37:06.610
A bit of internal chaos in Wushuang City...

37:07.030 --> 37:08.500
I can't believe the Patriarch of Blood River

37:08.550 --> 37:09.820
is actually so careless.

37:10.510 --> 37:11.980
Take a careful breath.

37:12.230 --> 37:13.250
Do you notice anything strange?

37:15.920 --> 37:18.820
There's a faint floral scent.

37:20.030 --> 37:20.860
In this season,

37:21.550 --> 37:23.130
what flowers could still be blooming in Sihuai City?

37:23.880 --> 37:25.290
Sihuai City

37:25.320 --> 37:26.340
is not Xueyue City.

37:26.440 --> 37:27.980
We don't have that kind of romance here.

37:28.670 --> 37:29.420
Floral scent?

37:30.110 --> 37:31.130
All I've smelled on the way here

37:31.320 --> 37:33.020
is wine and meat.

37:33.480 --> 37:34.460
It's poison.

37:35.480 --> 37:36.650
It is poison indeed.

37:36.960 --> 37:38.860
It just hasn't fully taken hold yet.

37:39.280 --> 37:40.770
Once the scent thickens

37:41.150 --> 37:43.460
and it feels as if you're standing in a sea of blossoms,

37:43.800 --> 37:44.820
that will be the perfect time

37:45.030 --> 37:47.420
for them to carve you up.

38:13.590 --> 38:14.380
The Five Poisons?

38:16.320 --> 38:18.170
Yes, and they're the supreme kind that only a direct heir

38:18.400 --> 38:19.540
of the Wen clan

38:19.760 --> 38:20.690
can raise.

38:22.150 --> 38:22.900
Go.

38:23.150 --> 38:23.980
I've heard

38:24.230 --> 38:25.480
they're even stronger than those

38:25.480 --> 38:26.290
of the Five Poisons Sect.

38:26.550 --> 38:27.610
I've seen

38:27.710 --> 38:28.900
Wen Hujiu's Five Poisons.

38:29.360 --> 38:30.460
His centipedes

38:30.590 --> 38:31.690
had two heads.

38:44.220 --> 38:47.700
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

38:47.740 --> 38:51.620
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

38:53.460 --> 38:56.940
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

38:56.980 --> 39:00.820
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

39:02.820 --> 39:06.100
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

39:06.220 --> 39:08.300
♪Still I can't let go♪

39:08.460 --> 39:11.900
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

39:12.380 --> 39:14.580
♪My heart no longer my own♪

39:14.700 --> 39:19.700
♪No one can escape from love♪

39:36.300 --> 39:40.020
♪How many hidden feelings♪

39:40.140 --> 39:44.220
♪Sink in silence deep?♪

39:45.460 --> 39:49.340
♪Searching through the endless nights♪

39:49.460 --> 39:53.700
♪Struggling on the edge of love and pain♪

39:54.820 --> 39:57.700
♪Shadows crossing shadows♪

39:57.780 --> 40:02.020
♪Whose name hides in your eyes?♪

40:04.300 --> 40:08.300
♪When the wind blows, ask not when I shall return♪

40:08.340 --> 40:11.780
♪Ask not when I shall return♪

40:13.300 --> 40:16.740
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

40:16.820 --> 40:20.620
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

40:22.540 --> 40:25.980
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

40:26.020 --> 40:29.860
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

40:31.900 --> 40:35.140
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

40:35.260 --> 40:37.340
♪Still I can't let go♪

40:37.540 --> 40:40.940
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

40:41.420 --> 40:43.620
♪My heart no longer my own♪

40:43.700 --> 40:48.740
♪No one can escape from love♪

